      161.85,
      316.45,
      401.9,
      400.72
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 2 of the Appropriation Act, No. 24 of 2016 ishereby amended in subsection (1) of that section, by thesubstitution in paragraph (b) of that subsection for the words\u201cshall not exceed rupees one thousand five hundred seventynine billion one hundred ten million four hundred thirty sixthousand\u201d, of the words \u201cshall not exceed rupees one thousandsix hundred twenty nine billion\u201d.",
